@startuml

actor Student
participant BookingService
participant BookingRepository

Student -> BookingService : bookRoom(room, start, end)

BookingService -> BookingService : validate future start and duration

alt invalid time
    BookingService --> Student : booking rejected
else valid time
    BookingService -> BookingRepository : check availability(room, start, end)
    BookingRepository --> BookingService : available / unavailable

    alt unavailable
        BookingService --> Student : room unavailable
    else available
        BookingService -> BookingRepository : save booking
        BookingRepository --> BookingService : booking created
        BookingService --> Student : confirmation
    end
end

note right of BookingService
Rules:
R1: start is in the future and
    duration is > 0 and <= 2 hours.
R3: blocked room cannot accept
    a new booking.
R4: successful booking produces
    a confirmation.
R2: availability check prevents
    overlapping active bookings.
end note

note bottom
Assumptions:
1. BookingRepository can determine whether
   the requested room/time is available.
2. A failed booking is not saved.
3. Touching bookings do not overlap.
end note

@enduml
